2026-06-12 15:40:47,336 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: At Faber IA, our AI & Innovation capabilities are centered around Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), which allows us to provide grounded answers that cite the passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus. Our approach includes structured extraction, such as assisting with PMSI/ICD-10 coding from clinical notes, and template-guided drafting for discharge summaries and correspondence.

